# CODEOWNERS — ScanDrix backend
#
# ScanDrix is a monorepo-free project: this repository holds the Go engine,
# its services, the CLI, the migrations and the infrastructure-as-code. The
# two frontends live in their own repositories (ScanDrix-Dashboard and
# ScanDrix-website) and are NOT covered by this file.
#
# One default owner is listed for the whole tree. Path-scoped rules are not
# added until a second maintainer exists: today every scoped rule would
# resolve to the same account, which makes the file look like a policy while
# enforcing nothing.
#
# GitHub will not count the owner's own approval as a review, so branch
# protection should require review from someone else once a second
# maintainer is added to this repository.
* @Santosh-Prasad-Verma
